		"description": "<p>Each creature of the [[/ref actor.name]]’s choice within 120 feet that can hear it makes a DC [[/ref actor.system.attributes.maneuverDC]] Charisma saving throw. On a failure, it is frightened for 1 minute. A creature repeats the saving throw at the end of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. When it succeeds on a saving throw or the effect ends for it, it is immune to Roar for 24 hours.</p>",
